* Sat Sep 26 2026 Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com> - 1.0.1-1
- Records the two stock hashes directly instead of naming a copy of each stock
  library, so the tripwire no longer costs this repository 53 KB of somebody
  else's binaries and the source package stops carrying them (docs/54). The
  payload, the effect and the deployed bytes are unchanged.
- Requires waydroid-ext-overlay-sync >= 1.1.0 for the hash-only stock column.
- The shipped payload is still this project's own NDK build and still shipped as
  bytes, which the policy permits: we produced it, from sources in this tree, on
  a signed commit.

